    "text": "WWMT\nwebsite\nKalamazoo\nIndependent candidate Thomas Durlach announces bid for Kalamazoo City Commission\nBy Katie Sergent,\n11 hours agoKALAMAZOO, Mich. — A Kalamazoo resident with a strong belief that the city has \"veered off course\" is looking to help steer the city in a new direction. This month, Thomas Durlach announced his candidacy for an open seat on the Kalamazoo City Commission. He joins fellow candidates Keshia Dickason, Kizzy N. Bradford and Drew Duncan, according to the City of Kalamazoo's website.",
